# NAFNet checkpoints (*.pth, ~260 MB for GoPro-width64) live here but are NOT
# committed (no Git-LFS in this repo; the SDK keeps ML weights out of git too).
# The node's Download Model button fetches them here as a background task, or
# drop them in manually per README.md; the folder then travels with the
# extension when it is copied, so a target machine needs no network.
*
!.gitignore
